  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;The proposed vehicle crossover, by reason of its excessive width and proximity to the adjacent street tree, would exceed the maximum width allowable for vehicular crossing over a grass verge, and would be likely to result in harm to the existing street tree and a loss of street greenery,&amp;nbsp; to the detriment of the communal amenity as well as the character and appearance of the local area. The proposal thereby fails to comply with policies DM1.B, DM23 and DM42.E of Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;The proposed hard surfacing, by reason of the proposed&amp;nbsp; impermeable paving materials and location within a Critical Drainage Area, would be likely to result in increased surface water run off both within and outside the application site. The proposal is thereby contrary to Policy SI 13 of the London Plan and policy DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
